//   AppRequests       | take 20
//   AppRequests       | summarize count() by bin(Timestamp, 1m) | render timechart
//   TrafficPerMinute  | order by Timestamp desc | take 20
//
// Po tym przejdź do fabric/07_anomaly_detector.md - tam konfiguracja wbudowanego
// Anomaly Detectora (Value to watch = Requests, Group by = OperationName,
// Timestamp = Timestamp na tabeli TrafficPerMinute).
